  _headline: "Bairro valoriza e aluguel expulsa quem j\xE1 morava"
  _headlineEn: Neighborhood booms; rents push old residents out
  _body: "A gentrifica\xE7\xE3o leva os antigos moradores embora. Dona Cida recebeu
    proposta pelo ponto e respondeu com o rolo de massa."
  _bodyEn: Gentrification drives long-time residents away. Mrs. Cida got an offer
    for her shop and replied with a rolling pin.
